ls</strong> to drift, dodge, and boost your way past competitors!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>CUSTOMIZE YOUR HAMSTER!</strong> \ud83d\udc39</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180310/extras/IMG_3.png?t=1743725420\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose your <strong>adorable</strong> <strong>hamster look</strong>, roll in a <strong>custom ball</strong>, and <strong>leave a trail mark\u00a0</strong>as you speed through the tracks. and\u00a0<strong>Celebrate your victories in style</strong> with <strong>hilarious victory emotes </strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udf0d <strong>EXPLORE DYNAMIC TRACKS!</strong> \ud83c\udfc1</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180310/extras/IMG_4.png?t=1743725420\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Race through <strong>stunning environments</strong>, from <strong>Candy World to  Space tracks</strong>, each packed with exciting surprises! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u26a1 <strong>SUN FLOWER SUPER POWER-UPS </strong> \ud83c\udfa2</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180310/extras/IMG_5.png?t=1743725420\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Strategize your way to victory</strong> with well-timed boosts, shields, and sneaky tricks to outplay the competition, By Unleashing\u00a0<strong>crazy power-ups</strong> to <strong>boost past rivals, slow down opponents, and create total chaos\u00a0</strong>on the track!  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udee3\ufe0f <strong>MORE CONTENT ON THE WAY!\u00a0</strong>\ud83d\udccc</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Career Mode,  Challenges &amp; MORE updates!</strong><br><strong>New levels, features, and surprises are coming!</strong> The race never stops in <strong>Billie\u2019s Wheelie!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udf89 <strong>ROLL, RACE &amp; CHEEEEEEEESE YOUR WAY TO VICTORY!\u00a0</strong>\ud83c\udf89 </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc39\ud83d\udca8 <strong>Are you ready for a crazy hamster racing adventure?</strong> Jump in now and experience <strong>the thrill of speed and cheese-fueled fun!</strong> \ud83e\uddc0\ud83c\udfc6</p>","developers":["M4DOOM"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180310/dd4e9730698b83c29b291372dbc3720722d271f4/header.jpg?t=1743725420","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257112080,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257112080/movie480.mp4?t=1741474399","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257112080/movie_max.mp4?t=1741474399"},"name":"New Billie Character","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257112080/e941becc668ed0443fd8fb693346c912e078d149/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1741474399","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257112080/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1741474399","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257112080/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1741474399"}},{"highlight":true,"id":257054260,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257054260/movie480.mp4?t=1726088635","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257054260/movie_max.mp4?t=1726088635"},"name":"Billie's Wheelie Teaser","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257054260/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1726088635","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257054260/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1726088635","max":"http://video.aka